    <div class="callout trap">
        <strong>Gravity off plus an impulse is not a jump — it is an escape.</strong> Leave the
        cave's Player at Gravity Scale 0 and add an impulse and the character rises and
        <em>never stops rising</em>. No error, no warning, no ceiling. When a jump "works but
        feels wrong", read Gravity Scale and Body Type before you touch your code.
